                        "glosses": [
                            "An antihistamine and anticholinergic drug that blocks the effect of histamine at H₁ receptor sites, relieving allergy symptoms. It also reduces smooth muscle contraction, increases heart rate, and sedates the user by blocking muscarinic acetylcholine receptors (mAChRs)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f0eb00f4-a13c-461c-8b95-2a63f6cc4edf",
                                "sense_id": "e14e64bc-98f6-3044-a16b-eda151c01f3f",
                                "text": "Diphenhydramine is a convenient and cheap antihistamine for use, but there are other drugs that do not make the user tired."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
